&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-337842-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Widely thought to be a pseudonym.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-337842-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. The exact year and circumstances of McGallan&#039;s death are still disputed.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-337842-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. A pocket universe operated by a GOC member organization, touted primarily as a more ‘legitimate’ anomalous community in contrast to Three Portlands.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
