ot.com/user:info/mew-ltiverse" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5271378&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606185837" alt="Mew-ltiverse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5271378)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mew-ltiverse" >Mew-ltiverse</a></span></p> 
