&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;Exploration&amp;nbsp;Log&amp;nbsp;14&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Exploration&amp;nbsp;Log&amp;nbsp;14&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Unit:&lt;/strong&gt; Iota-27 (“Art Connoisseurs”)&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;MTF Squad:&lt;/strong&gt; Delta-2&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5487-1:&lt;/strong&gt; Ascending and Descending by MC Escher&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Task:&lt;/strong&gt; Locate and interview SCP-5487-2&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Foreword:&lt;/strong&gt; This log was recovered from the person of Lt. Johnson. The log had been damaged by a bullet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Log&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(Lt. Johnson, Sgt. Anderson, Pvt. Miller, and Pvt. Carter are standing on the lower staircase at the bottom right corner of the painting.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lt. Johnson:&lt;/strong&gt; Miller, you&#039;re with me. Us two will take this side, you two take that side. Check back here every 10 minutes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(Lt. Johnson and Pvt. Miller begin clearing rooms on the right side. Sgt.Anderson and Pvt. Carter take the left side rooms.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[Data Lost]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pvt. Miller:&lt;/strong&gt; minutes sir, I think we should head back.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lt. Johnson:&lt;/strong&gt; Alright, let’s go see if Sgt. Anderson has found anything.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(Miller and Johnson go back to the starting point. Anderson is nowhere to be found.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lt. Johnson:&lt;/strong&gt; They aren&#039;t here yet, let’s wait 5 minutes and go look for them if they&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[Data Lost]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(Johnson and Miller are standing outside of one of the rooms. Inside voices can be heard, but no words can be made out.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lt. Johnson:&lt;/strong&gt; 3. 2. 1. Breach!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(Lt. Johnson kicks open e door and inside Anderson and Carter are tied to wooden chairs. 5 armed men bearing no insignias are present. Johnson and Miller are able to fire 7shots before ducking back behind the wall. 2 men get injured and one is killed.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unknown:&lt;/strong&gt; You, go find Captain. Tell him we are under attack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(Johnson looks back through the door and kills another combatant before being shot in the abdomen.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[Data Lost]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(Johnson’s body was dragged from the building and left on the ground outside. While still recording, the camera does not reveal anything else.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Log&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
