ass="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;SCP-194</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>By SCP wiki Reader: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCkUb1bizHZh8-sqJ9ULfL4w">Channel</a></p> <p><iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/b-NSG5-v63o" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen=""></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;SCP-5545</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;SCP-5545</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>By Dr. Maxwell - SCP Readings: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpSfn3QPY0Yo3x29VFBRkOw">Channel</a></p> <p><iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/3yBsCHT_gTg" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen=""></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-4" style="display:none"> <p>So there are plenty of progress trackers and achievement things here on the site, and I decided to just throw all of them into this one tab. Hope you enjoy.</p> <h1><span>Contest Entries and Rankings</span></h1> <p>I really enjoy the contests here on the site, and I've been happy to participate when I could! Here are the rankings for the contests I've participated in.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;JamCon&nbsp;2020&nbsp;Rankings</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;JamCon&nbsp;2020&nbsp;Rankings</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/i-am-become-death">I Am Become Death</a>; +14 by voting period's end. <ul> <li>10th place for tales for Theme 1 (Explosions)</li> <li>44th place overall for Theme 1</li> <li>18th place for tales overall</li> <li>90th place overall</li> </ul> </li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5559">SCP-5559 (Restaurant Rivalry)</a>; +19 by voting period's end. <ul> <li>10th place for SCPs for Theme 2 (Delicious)</li> <li>18th place overall for Theme 2</li> <li>35th place for SCPs overall</li> <li>58th place overall</li> </ul> </li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/uiu-file-2001-023">UIU File: 2001-023 (Moore Then Meets The Eye)</a>; +43 by voting period's end. <ul> <li>2nd place for GoI formats for Theme 3 (More Than Meets The Eye)</li> <li>9th place overall for Theme 3</li> <li>4th place for GoI formats overall</li> <li>26th place overall</li> </ul> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;CorpseCon&nbsp;2020&nbsp;Rankings</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;CorpseCon&nbsp;2020&nbsp;Rankings</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <ul> <li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">SCP-5366: If you're ever; +19 (34th place) by voting period's end. ConProcs received.</span> Self-deleted after the contest.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5545">SCP-5545: 𝙰 𝙱 𝙽 𝙾 𝚁 𝙼 𝙰 𝙻 𝙸 𝚃 𝚈</a>; +127 (2nd place) by voting period's end. ConProcs given.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <h1><span>Achievement Badges</span></h1> <h3><span>Badges from the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-achievement-badges">SCP Achievement Badges</a> page.</span></h3> <ul> <li><strong>Certificate Of Attendance:</strong> Post an Author Page, add to a Collaborative Log, and participate in an Official SCP Wiki Contest.</li> <li><strong>Draw Me Like One Of Your [REDACTED]:</strong> Create an artwork page with a rating of at least +30.</li> <li><strong>Participation Trophy:</strong> Write an article rated at least +100.</li> <li><strong>Straight Out Of Central Casting:</strong> Create a character who merits their own tag and has been featured in works by 3 other writers.</li> <li><strong>Lore Expert:</strong> You've written at least 3 GOI articles and/or skips rated +50 or above.</li> <li><strong>The Medium Is The Message:</strong> Author of at least 10 media files (images, audio, videos, etc.) that are used on the wiki. Must be original works released under a version CC-by-SA license compatible with the SCP Wiki.</li> <li><strong>Look Ma! I'm On TV!:</strong> Have one of your works be featured on an off-site video, podcast, video game, etc.</li> <li><strong>Level Up!:</strong> You've been a member of the SCP Wiki for one calendar year.</li> <li><strong>Skip Tutoring:</strong> Have an SCP draft thread you gave feedback on succeed on the main list.</li> <li><strong>Extra! Extra!:</strong> One of your articles has been featured on the front page.</li> <li><strong>Distinguished Butterfly:</strong> Be featured on the Reviewers' Spotlight.</li> <li><strong>Pagemaster:</strong> Contribute icons or new achievements to the SCP Achievement Badges Page.</li> </ul> <h3><span>Badges from the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/achievement-badges">Achievement Badges For Fun</a> page.</span></h3> <ul> <li><strong>(006) I'm coming!:</strong> First article (SCP/tale/GOI-format/artwork) posted after joining the site rated at least +60.</li> <li><strong>(016) Teleportation:</strong> Used at least 5 different themes that fit the article.