				<title>SCP-5133</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5133</link>
				<description>


&lt;div class=&quot;info-container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;{$comments}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;u-author_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;[{$authorPage} ▸ More by this Author ◂]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;translation_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;Translations:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;u-faq&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/component:info-ayers&quot;&gt;F.A.Q.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-5133/skeleton.png&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; alt=&quot;skeleton.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5133&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5133&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Euclid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5133&#039;s movements are to be monitored at all times within its cell. SCP-5133 must always be contained in a&lt;br /&gt;
270cm by 270cm by 270cm cell with the walls being made of 15cm of galvanized steel. Under no circumstances are foundation personal, excluding D&lt;br /&gt;
class, to be in SCP-5133&#039;s cell for risk of being disintegrated.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; Held at Site ██, SCP-5133 is an anomalous entity resembling the remains of an unknown male who has suffered from Fibrodysplasia ossificans progressiva (FOP). The Being is capable of decaying and disintegration objects (including other beings) that it touches. The effect of this disintegration becomes stronger and faster the longer the object is held. SCP-5133&#039;s origin is currently unknown as well as the age of it. SCP-5133 is 184 centimeters tall and weighs approximately 15kg.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5133 is sentient but is very rarely seen to be in a violent state. The Entity seems not to dislike the foundation but does not express any good feelings towards it. It is often found roaming its containment cell in a slumped posture and occasionally falls to the floor in a ball and appears to be crying but no sound or tears are made. Given that SCP-5133 is purely made of bone with a little tissue, it is quite odd that it can stand and walk. No running from the entity has been witnessed yet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If any living being is within two meters of SCP-5133, the living being will try to be embraced in SCP-5133&#039;s arms. If the living being avoids SCP-5133&#039;s embrace then the SCP will go into a hysteric state.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5133 will begin to sob without noise into its hands and after 7 seconds will lunge at the living subject and keep doing so until hid from, blocked off from or gone a considerable distance from. after which SCP-5133 will resume its normal behaviour.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5133 can communicate through scratching words onto galvanized steel. The words will only remain for approximately a minute before disappearing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span&gt;*Incident*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;Show&amp;nbsp;Excerpt&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;Incident&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident Alpha:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Details:&lt;/strong&gt; During a containment breach at the same sight that SCP-5133 was at, the wall of its cell had broken. This allowed it to walk out of its cell. It continued to walk through the corridors and it came across a female foundation researcher. The researcher screamed just before being embraced in SCP-5133&#039;s arms. 30 seconds later the researchers&#039; skin began to break down. After 1 minute and 30 seconds, only the researchers&#039; glasses were left. A D-class was then sent to lure SCP-5133 back into its cell where a sheet of galvanised steel was placed onto the break until the break could be fixed properly. The D-class perished in the process.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Solution:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SCP-5133&#039;s cell walls are to be reinforced with stainless steel as well as adding 3 more centimetres of galvanised steel to them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;INTERVIEWED:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5133&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;INTERVIEWER:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr. Paul Gray&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;DATE OF LOG:&lt;/strong&gt; 1/15/19 Approx. 12:15 Local Time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[IRRELEVANT INFORMATION OMITTED — BEGIN LOG]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Gray:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent. To begin, how did you come to be?&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5133:&lt;/strong&gt; *scratches* &lt;em&gt;Human&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Gray:&lt;/strong&gt; Right&amp;#8230; Were you once human?&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5133:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;I am&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Gray:&lt;/strong&gt; So you are currently human?&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;SCP-5133&#039;s hand hesitates before writing.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5133:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Aren&#039;t I?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Gray:&lt;/strong&gt; No. You appear as the remains of a person.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;SCP-5133 looks down at its hands and puts its hands to its face.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Gray:&lt;/strong&gt; Eh, hello?&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;SCP-5133 Lifts its hand and bangs the steel table once.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Gray:&lt;/strong&gt; Calm down. I&#039;ve only got one more question.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;SCP-5133 looks up at Dr. Gray&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Gray:&lt;/strong&gt; Ok. Are you aware of your anomalous ability to disintegrate things?&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;SCP-5133 hesitates once more.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5133:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Too many questions&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;SCP-5133 places its hand on the protective glass between them and the glass starts to decay.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Dr. Gray calls off the interview as the glass starts cracking&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[END LOG]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
