&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/i-say-this-that-you-suffer&quot;&gt;i say this that you suffer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kadakúni
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/light-of-the-north&quot;&gt;Light of the North, Or the Three Impossible Tasks of Te̮la&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/suekni-and-the-firebird&quot;&gt;Sükni and the Firebird&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/the-catching-of-the-sun&quot;&gt;The Catching of the Sun&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Klavigar Character Studies
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/tuae&quot;&gt;Tuae&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
